# ───────────────────────── secrets ─────────────────────────
# The production boot reads PLATFORM_PASSWORD / ADMIN_PASSWORD / LUXORA_MASTER_KEY /
# LUXORA_PEPPER / LX_METRICS_TOKEN from the environment; operators keep them in a .env
# next to the repo. A dotfile with a live key in it is how a repo leaks, so every
# spelling is ignored and the .env.example (if one ships) is kept explicitly.
.env
.env.*
.env.local
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# the keyring (data/master.json) and the registry seal (data/registry.json) are
# per-deployment secrets: losing the keyring loses the ability to decrypt sealed
# gateway credentials, and the seal is reproducible from the corpora, never stored
data/master.json
data/registry.json
# scripts/backup.js sets: a database copy AND the keyring that decrypts it
data/backups/

# ───────────────────────── runtime state ─────────────────────────
node_modules/
.luxora.pid
.luxora*.pid
*.pid
*.sock
server.log
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# a test boots its own throwaway store (test/<name>.db) and deletes it on exit; a
# killed run leaves the file behind, so these are never committed either. The same
# goes for any stray database anywhere in the tree, not just data/ and test/.
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
data/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite-wal
data/*.sqlite-shm
data/exports/
test/*.db
test/*.db-wal
test/*.db-shm
test/*.sqlite
test/*.sqlite-wal
test/*.sqlite-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# the compiled single source of truth is DERIVED from the corpora + the authored
# _registry/*.json inputs: it is sealed with a per-deployment key and re-compiles
# deterministically, so the artifacts are never committed. The sources are the
# authority; the seal is reproducible, verifiable, not stored.
_registry/canonical.json
_registry/canonical.lxr

# ───────────────────────── build & coverage output ─────────────────────────
coverage/
dist/
build/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
.nyc_output/

# ───────────────────────── OS junk ─────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
__MACOSX/
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ───────────────────────── editors & IDEs ─────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.history/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ───────────────────────── scratch ─────────────────────────
/tmp
